===Etymology 1===
From {{compound|cat|fish|lang=en}}. Likely so named for its prominent [[barbel]]s like a [[cat#English|cat]]'s [[whisker]]s.

====Noun====
{{en-noun|~|catfish|catfishes}}

# Any fish of the order [[Siluriformes]], mainly found in [[freshwater|fresh water]], lacking [[scale]]s, and having [[barbel]]s like [[whisker]]s around the mouth.

